# All knobs at both ends (dx ignores filter and resonance), very low and very high notes (operators above 16 kHz fade
# out, above 20 kHz they are muted), velocity 1, P1/P2 jumps (patch 31 FM TOM, patch 0, patch 11 BRASS) and a pitch
# bend.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.5
track lead
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C0 4 127
note 4 C8 4 127
param p1 0 8
param p2 0 8
note 8 C2 4 1
param p1 92 12
param p2 255 12
note 12 G6 4 127
bend 12 200
expect peak_below -3
